B.wy=new A.aT(B.a17,["Hi! I'm so glad you're here! Here on the Little Farm, everything lost its color. You're going to help me color the places and the animals: first the meadow, then the henhouse, the pigpen and the pond. Every three animals you color, a new place opens up. And at the end there's a magic surprise! Tap Let's play!","Hi! I'm Z\xe9, and this is Tot\xf3! Welcome to our farm! This is the meadow... but it has no color at all. Look, let's color it!","All done, the meadow has its colors back! Now it's your turn: pick an animal down below to color!","Look, we're at the henhouse! The hen, the rooster, the chick and other birds live here. But it has no color... let's color it!","All done, the henhouse has its colors back! Now it's your turn: pick a bird down below to color!","Look who's here! It's the pigpen, the home of the little pigs, who love to play in the mud! And here in the backyard live the kittens, the bunny and the parrot. But it has no color... let's color it!","All done, the backyard has its colors back! Now it's your turn: pick an animal down below to color!","Shh... we're at the pond! The duck, the duckling, the teal, the goose, the frog, the little fish, the terrapin, the turtle and the capybara live here. But it has no color... let's color it!","All done, the pond has its colors back! Now it's your turn: pick an animal down below to color!","You colored the whole farm! Tap the Surprise star up there to see who arrived!","Wow! You colored the whole farm! Look, what magic: a unicorn and a little dinosaur came for a special party! But the party has no color... let's color it!","All done, the party has its colors back! Now pick the unicorn or the little dinosaur down below to color!","Congratulations! You colored the whole farm, even the unicorn and the little dinosaur! What a beautiful party! Now the farm is yours: you can visit every place you colored. Tap My farm!","Look at your farm! These are the pictures of all the places you colored. Tap a picture to visit it again!","Pick a color and tap the drawing to color it!","It looks beautiful! Now tap Done!","Only five more minutes until we rest! Shall we finish this drawing?","Hi! Playtime is over for today. The animals are resting. Tomorrow we'll color some more!","That's all for today! The animals are going to rest. Tomorrow we'll color some more. Bye-bye!","This place is still closed! Meanwhile, shall we play a little more in the meadow?","Yay! Now the whole farm is open! Let's color!","Bye-bye! It was so much fun playing with you! Tot\xf3 and the animals will be waiting for you here on the farm.","the wing","the other wing","a little wing","the wings","the little beard","the wattle","the belly","the beak","the cheeks","the head","the hooves","the tail","the horns","the body","the mane","the comb","the little flower","the snout","the little collar","the wool","the little spot","the spots","the ears","the inside of the ears","the little feet","the chest","the fur","the middle feather","the dots","the feathers","the pompom","the tail","the face","the little bell","the topknot","the udder","the carrot","the carrot leaves","the little arm","the little leg","the leaf","the fins","the shell","the edge of the shell","the flippers","the horn","the plates on its back","the wing tips","the perch","the orange kitten's head","the orange kitten's body","the orange kitten's tail","the gray kitten's head","the gray kitten's body","the gray kitten's tail","the little mouth","the collar","the little collar","the feather patterns","the back of the fan","the little eyes","the little wing feathers","the orange kitten's paws","the orange kitten's face","the orange kitten's ears","the orange kitten's eyes","the orange kitten's nose","the orange kitten's mouth","the gray kitten's paws","the gray kitten's face","the gray kitten's ears","the gray kitten's eyes","the gray kitten's nose","the gray kitten's mouth","a fan feather","a tail feather","one more little part","Horse","Little Cow","Little Sheep","Little Calf","Goat","Cinnamon the Donkey","Pony","Hen","Rooster","Chick","Turkey","Guinea Fowl","Peacock","Pig","Piglet","Kittens","Bunny","Parrot","Duck","Duckling","Teal","Goose","Frog","Little Fish","Terrapin","Turtle","Capybara","Unicorn","Little Dinosaur","Clip-clop, clip-clop!","Moooo!","Moo!","Baaa!","Hee-haw!","Cluck, cluck, cluck!","Cock-a-doodle-doo!","Cheep, cheep!","Gobble, gobble!","Buck-wheat, buck-wheat!","May-awe! May-awe!","Baaa!","Oink, oink!","Oink!","Meow, meow!","Hop, hop!","Squawk!","Quack, quack!","Quack!","Quack, quack, quack!","Honk, honk!","Splash!","Ribbit, ribbit!","Blub, blub!","Munch, munch!","Hmm, hmm!","Neigh, neigh!","Twinkle, twinkle!","Roooar!","Woof, woof!","Little Farm","Let's play!","Meadow","Henhouse","Pigpen","Pigpen and backyard","Pond","Surprise!","Magic party","Party","Back to playing","Parents\u2019 area","Everything is saved only on this device. Nothing is sent to the internet.","Complete Little Farm","Screen time per day","No limit","+15 min today","No limit just for today","Sounds","Z\xe9's voice","Animal sounds and Tot\xf3's bark","Child",'Nickname (shown on "My Little Farm")',"Age","Parents\u2019 password","Change password","Farm","Erases all the coloring and the game starts over.","Erase the farm","Erase the farm?","All the coloring will be erased and this cannot be undone.","Cancel","Erase","My farm","My Little Farm","Not now","Back to the meadow","Back","Undo","Done!","See you soon!","Play again","Allow more time today?","Let them rest","It\u2019s not playtime yet","Time to rest!","Thanks for testing!","Parents\u2019 area: press and hold to open","Parents: hold","Bye","Purchased! The whole farm is unlocked on this device.","Buy the complete farm","Restore purchase","Try again","The passwords don\u2019t match. Try again.","Wrong password.","Wrong answer.","Create a 4-digit password for the parents\u2019 area","Enter the password again to confirm","Enter the parents\u2019 password","I forgot the password","No purchase found on this Apple account.","The purchase could not be completed. Try again.","The Apple store did not respond. Check the internet and try again.","Henhouse, Pigpen and backyard, Pond and the final Surprise","Colorful meadow of the Little Farm.","Magic party on the farm with a rainbow and little flags.","Pond with a pier, water lilies and cattails.","Pigpen with mud and a backyard with little houses.","Henhouse with a straw nest, a ramp and a yard.","My farm: pictures of the colored places.","Language","Z\xe9","This is a test version: the whole farm is open, with no purchase, and the paths between places are already unlocked.","This is the free demo: only the meadow is open. The complete farm (Henhouse, Pigpen and backyard, Pond and the Magic party) will be in the iPad app."],t.l)
